            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 17.5 Changes to the Current Plan. Subject to action by the Company's Board of Directors (or its delegate) and to the approvals specified in 17.2, as well as any changes required by applicable law, all provisions of The Boeing Company Employee Retirement Plan are to remain unchanged with the exception of the following amendments:",
