            "block_content": "Section 17.6 Administration of the Retirement Plan. The Company shall have the right to unilaterally make any changes in actuarial assumptions and funding methods, provided such changes are determined by the Plan's enrolled actuary to be reasonable in the aggregate. The Company shall be entitled to unilaterally adopt such amendments to the Plan as may be required in order to obtain any approval referred to in 17.1 and described in 17.2 of the Agreement.",
